##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Grid T-junction cracks (#51) in the zbuffer hider, which dices like reyes:
# depth-analytic-min-reyes.rib at ShadingRate 0.5. The zbuffer hider keeps
# no transparency, so a crack shows in depth instead: where two grids diced at
# different rates leave a gap, the pixel centre misses the front surface and
# reads the sphere's back.
version 3.03
Hider "zbuffer" "jitter" [0]
Option "hider" "depthfilter" "min"
ShadingRate 0.5
PixelSamples 1 1
PixelFilter "box" 1 1
Display "depth-analytic-min-tjunction-r0.5-zbuffer.tif" "file" "z"
Projection "perspective" "fov" 45
Format 160 120 1
Translate 0 0 6

WorldBegin
  Sides 2
  Sphere 1.5 -1.5 1.5 360

  AttributeBegin
    Translate 0.5 0.3 -3
    Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
  AttributeEnd

  AttributeBegin
    Translate 1.9 -1 -1.5
    Sphere 0.6 -0.6 0.6 360
  AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
